    claims legitimately exist) and plants a marker on the bare name itself, so a bare-name
    respawn hits the same wall. No --force, no confirmation: releasing another session's work
    is this command's PURPOSE — it is the tool the orchestrator lacked while hand-editing
    status three times on 08-14. Everything it does is printed."""
    target = a.target.strip()
